{"type": "tool_result", "name": "read_file", "tool_call_id": "call_bede4598a4c64f7785125b6fa2e4dff6", "output": "{\"content\": \"1|# Committee meeting, 11 August 2026\\n2|\\n3|Present: Tessa Varga, Ibrahim Solheim, Nell Okonjo, Paolo Drummond, Wren Castellan.\\n4|\\n5|Noticeboard: the paint is peeling and the notices blow away. Odile\\n6|Fairweather has offered to repaint it. She will do it by 25 August.\\n7|\\n8|Electricity: the bill for the shed lights for 2025 was $96.20 for the whole\\n9|year. Paolo will move us to the cheaper night rate.\\n10|\\n11|Water: members keep asking for a second tap at the far end of the plots.\\n12|Nell will ask the city whether we may add one, by 8 September.\\n13|\\n14|Next meeting 25 August.\", \"total_lines\": 14, \"file_size\": 548, \"truncated\": false, \"is_binary\": false, \"is_image\": false, \"not_found\": false}", "duration_ms": 109, "is_error": false, "timestamp": 1794681600284}
{"type": "tool_result", "name": "read_file", "tool_call_id": "call_723826cf5cd44640886e73fe5f6e9cee", "output": "{\"content\": \"1|# Committee meeting, 26 August 2026\\n2|\\n3|Moved from Monday 25 August because of the storm.\\n4|\\n5|Present: Tessa Varga, Nell Okonjo, Paolo Drummond, Wren Castellan.\\n6|Apologies: Ibrahim Solheim.\\n7|\\n8|Paolo has moved the shed lights to the night rate.\\n9|\\n10|Nell has not yet reached the city about the second tap. She will try again\\n11|before the next meeting.\\n12|\\n13|Seed swap: held on 23 August; about thirty members came.\\n14|\\n15|Next meeting 8 September.\", \"total_lines\": 15, \"file_size\": 421, \"truncated\": false, \"is_binary\": false, \"is_image\": false, \"not_found\": false}", "duration_ms": 93, "is_error": false, "timestamp": 1794681600288}
{"type": "tool_result", "name": "read_file", "tool_call_id": "call_3e873bb63565482481d197abed14edd0", "output": "{\"content\": \"1|# Committee meeting, 20 October 2026\\n2|\\n3|Present: Tessa Varga, Nell Okonjo, Paolo Drummond, Wren Castellan.\\n4|Apologies: Ibrahim Solheim.\\n5|\\n6|Gate latch: Wren replaced it on 18 October. It closes properly now.\\n7|\\n8|Compost arrived on 15 October and is in the bays.\\n9|\\n10|Roof: finished on 17 October and it looks good. The invoice came in at\\n11|$1,560, which is $80 over the quote. Paolo will ask the roofer what the $80\\n12|is for, by 27 October, before we pay.\\n13|\\n14|Second tap: Dov has not heard back from the city. He will chase them by\\n15|3 November.\\n16|\\n17|Work day: set for Saturday 14 November, 09:30 to 12:30. Members should bring\\n18|gloves; the club supplies soup. Nell will book the tool-sharpening person so\\n19|they are there on the day.\\n20|\\n21|Next meeting 3 November.\", \"total_lines\": 21, \"file_size\": 732, \"truncated\": false, \"is_binary\": false, \"is_image\": false, \"not_found\": false}", "duration_ms": 64, "is_error": false, "timestamp": 1794681600291}
{"type": "tool_result", "name": "read_file", "tool_call_id": "call_6b2cece5e8a24ec493f637ff6ac23e33", "output": "{\"content\": \"1|# Committee meeting, 6 October 2026\\n2|\\n3|Present: Tessa Varga, Ibrahim Solheim, Nell Okonjo, Paolo Drummond, Wren Castellan.\\n4|\\n5|Roof: Paolo has booked the roofer for 17 October.\\n6|\\n7|Fees: Ibrahim sent the reminders on 28 September and eleven members have\\n8|paid since.\\n9|\\n10|Gate latch: still broken. Wren volunteered to replace it and will do it by\\n11|20 October.\\n12|\\n13|Winter: we close the garden at the end of November. Tessa will draft a\\n14|winter closing checklist, the same as last year's with the water shut-off\\n15|added, by 3 November.\\n16|\\n17|Compost is ordered, Nell says, and due mid-month.\\n18|\\n19|Next meeting 20 October.\", \"total_lines\": 19, \"file_size\": 591, \"truncated\": false, \"is_binary\": false, \"is_image\": false, \"not_found\": false}", "duration_ms": 56, "is_error": false, "timestamp": 1794681600300}
{"type": "tool_result", "name": "read_file", "tool_call_id": "call_266f47eaebfc4dffa74e56254cc32ed9", "output": "{\"content\": \"1|# Committee meeting, 8 September 2026\\n2|\\n3|Present: Tessa Varga, Ibrahim Solheim, Nell Okonjo, Paolo Drummond, Wren Castellan.\\n4|\\n5|The shed roof leaked again in last week's rain. We agreed it needs replacing\\n6|before winter rather than another patch. Tessa will get three quotes for the\\n7|roof and bring them to the next meeting on 22 September.\\n8|\\n9|Fees: about a third of members have not paid for the autumn season. Ibrahim\\n10|will email a reminder to everyone by 15 September.\\n11|\\n12|The latch on the main gate is broken and the gate swings open in wind.\\n13|Somebody needs to fix it. Nobody had time this month.\\n14|\\n15|Water: the bill for 2026 so far is $312.40, a little under last year's pace\\n16|according to Paolo, who did not have last year's figure with him.\\n17|\\n18|Thanks to Odile for the freshly painted noticeboard, which members say is\\n19|much easier to read.\\n20|\\n21|Second tap: Nell is still waiting to hear from the city.\\n22|\\n23|Next meeting 22 September.\", \"total_lines\": 23, \"file_size\": 914, \"truncated\": false, \"is_binary\": false, \"is_image\": false, \"not_found\": false}", "duration_ms": 58, "is_error": false, "timestamp": 1794681600305}
{"type": "tool_result", "name": "read_file", "tool_call_id": "call_b5b779310d754ea4afcd1e12fe379dce", "output": "{\"content\": \"1|# Committee meeting, 3 November 2026\\n2|\\n3|Present: Tessa Varga, Ibrahim Solheim, Nell Okonjo, Paolo Drummond, Wren Castellan.\\n4|\\n5|Checklist: Tessa circulated the draft winter closing checklist last week.\\n6|All committee members are to send her their comments by 10 November.\\n7|\\n8|Roof invoice: Paolo has not heard back from the roofer about the extra $80.\\n9|He will chase them by 10 November. We do not pay until we know.\\n10|\\n11|Work day, 14 November: Nell has booked the tool sharpener, who will come at\\n12|10:00. Ibrahim will send the work-day notice to all members by 7 November.\\n13|Wren will shut off the water for the winter on the work day itself.\\n14|\\n15|Second tap: Dov says the city has the request but has not decided. He will\\n16|call again by 17 November.\\n17|\\n18|Water: the bill for 2026 came to $486.75 in total.\\n19|\\n20|No further meetings this year.\", \"total_lines\": 20, \"file_size\": 814, \"truncated\": false, \"is_binary\": false, \"is_image\": false, \"not_found\": false}", "duration_ms": 58, "is_error": false, "timestamp": 1794681600309}
{"type": "tool_result", "name": "read_file", "tool_call_id": "call_aef56236f8914ca4a0e84301dfc11192", "output": "{\"content\": \"1|# Committee meeting, 22 September 2026\\n2|\\n3|Present: Tessa Varga, Ibrahim Solheim, Nell Okonjo, Paolo Drummond.\\n4|Apologies: Wren Castellan.\\n5|\\n6|Roof: Tessa brought three quotes, $1,250, $1,480 and $1,900. We chose the\\n7|middle one because it includes taking the old roofing away. Paolo will book\\n8|the roofer, and wants it done before the 6 October meeting.\\n9|\\n10|Fee reminders have not gone out yet. Ibrahim was away and will send them by\\n11|29 September instead.\\n12|\\n13|Compost: the bays are nearly empty. Nell will order four cubic metres by\\n14|2 October so it arrives before the beds are put to sleep.\\n15|\\n16|Gate latch: still broken. Not discussed further.\\n17|\\n18|Second tap: Nell has too much on with the compost. Dov Marchetti, who first\\n19|asked for the tap, will take over asking the city, by 20 October.\\n20|\\n21|Next meeting 6 October.\", \"total_lines\": 21, \"file_size\": 795, \"truncated\": false, \"is_binary\": false, \"is_image\": false, \"not_found\": false}", "duration_ms": 56, "is_error": false, "timestamp": 1794681600316}
